  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Great our <chord name="Am/C"/>joy as <chord name="F"/>now we gather<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Where <chord name="C"/>the <chord name="Gm"/>Master <chord name="Am"/>makes <chord name="F"/>us <chord name="Gm"/>one:<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Where <chord name="F"/>we <chord name="Am"/>worship <chord name="Edim"/>God <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="C"/>Father<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Thro&#x27; the <chord name="Am"/>Spirit <chord name="C"/>of <chord name="Am"/>His Son.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>All <chord name="Am"/>who <chord name="Gm"/>search <chord name="F"/>for His <chord name="Gm"/>church<br/>
      <chord name="Gm"/>Find it where His <chord name="F"/>will is done.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Precious <chord name="Am/C"/>is the <chord name="F"/>tie that binds us<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>To <chord name="C"/>our <chord name="Gm"/>God when <chord name="Am"/>faith <chord name="Gm"/>grows <chord name="F"/>cold;<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Precious all that <chord name="Edim"/>now <chord name="F"/>reminds <chord name="C/E"/>us<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>He is <chord name="Am"/>still <chord name="Dm"/>our <chord name="C"/>safe <chord name="Am"/>stronghold.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Faithful <chord name="Gm"/>love <chord name="F"/>serves to <chord name="Gm"/>prove<br/>
      <chord name="Gm"/>Here the Shepherd <chord name="F"/>has His fold.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>May we <chord name="Am/C"/>learn from <chord name="F"/>Christ&#x27;s example<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>How <chord name="C"/>to <chord name="Gm"/>use this <chord name="Am"/>house <chord name="Gm"/>of <chord name="F"/>prayer:<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>He <chord name="F"/>who <chord name="Am"/>loved and <chord name="Edim"/>cleansed <chord name="F"/>His <chord name="C"/>temple<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Wants us <chord name="Am"/>all <chord name="Dm"/>to <chord name="C"/>worship <chord name="Am"/>there.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>God <chord name="Am"/>the <chord name="Gm"/>Son <chord name="F"/>shuts out <chord name="Gm"/>none:<br/>
      <chord name="Gm"/>In His Kingdom <chord name="F"/>all may share.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Lord, inspire <chord name="Am"/>us <chord name="F"/>with Your vision<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Of <chord name="C"/>a <chord name="Gm"/>world which <chord name="Am"/>must <chord name="Gm"/>be <chord name="F"/>won!<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Glorious is <chord name="Gm"/>the <chord name="Edim"/>church&#x27;s <chord name="Gm"/>mission,<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Long endeavored, scarce <chord name="Am"/>begun!<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Faithful <chord name="Gm"/>now- <chord name="F"/>this is <chord name="Gm"/>how<br/>
      <chord name="Gm"/>God&#x27;s eternal <chord name="F"/>will is done.
      </lines>
    </verse>
  </lyrics>
